{"id":"n37278-1-8","stage":3,"title":"낙엽 · 掉叶","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37278-1-8-1","ko":"우리 단풍놀이 가지 않을래?","zh":"我们去赏红叶吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"단풍놀이","meaning":"赏枫","explanation":"단풍놀이：赏枫。","readings":[{"term":"단풍놀이","audio":"/audio/15c6c9f5a4fe43669720.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42078","senseId":"1","lemma":"단풍놀이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"단풍놀이","audio":"/audio/15c6c9f5a4fe43669720.mp3"}},{"text":"가지","meaning":"去，前往","explanation":"가다：去，前往；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"3","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3"}},{"text":"않을래?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；을래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않을래","audio":"/audio/97b59f36ceff553040f9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"15c6c9f5a4fe4366","term":"단풍놀이","zh":"赏枫","audio":"/audio/15c6c9f5a4fe43669720.mp3","entryId":"42078","definition":"观赏枫叶美景的事。","pronunciation":["단풍노리"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，前往","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为参加某种聚会而移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/655fea209ac1b2485a46.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37278-1-8-2","ko":"그래. 다음 주부터는 낙엽이 진다고 하니까 이번 주말에 가자.","zh":"好，听说下周叶子就开始落了，这周末去吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"주부터는","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；부터：表示起点：“从……起”；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주부터는","audio":"/audio/27ec90d7e9f414085e5f.mp3"}},{"text":"낙엽이","meaning":"掉叶，落叶","explanation":"낙엽：掉叶，落叶；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"낙엽","audio":"/audio/9e543e543e48944d4ca4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37278","senseId":"1","lemma":"낙엽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낙엽이","audio":"/audio/2f01d28cfd37697b8d5e.mp3"}},{"text":"진다고","meaning":"凋谢","explanation":"지다：凋谢；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62496","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진다고","audio":"/audio/3d84d2a57bcb51ab1a7d.mp3"}},{"text":"하니까","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하니까","audio":"/audio/c5687c04fe55d30da1c1.mp3"}},{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에","audio":"/audio/ff068f34f21f5a2dea38.mp3"}},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去，前往","explanation":"가다：去，前往；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"3","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가자","audio":"/audio/9d6a16e0f490c47dce42.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"9e543e543e48944d","term":"낙엽","zh":"掉叶，落叶","audio":"/audio/9e543e543e48944d4ca4.mp3","entryId":"37278","definition":"主要指秋天树叶从树上掉落。","pronunciation":["나겹"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"凋谢","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"62496","definition":"花或叶子枯萎掉落。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，前往","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为参加某种聚会而移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3da57f794cd668f1dede.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.745,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37278","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":118,"sequenceScore":3.1203,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好，听说下周叶子就开始落了，这周末去吧。","我们去赏红叶吧？","你不是说今天有约吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我们去赏红叶吧？","你不是说今天有约吗？","好，听说下周叶子就开始落了，这周末去吧。"],"answer":2}]}
